20个模块, 每个500+行生产级代码, 基于M906-M925历史数据层构建分析与预测层

分析引擎层 (M966-M975):
- M966 HistoricalPatternRecognizer: 滑动窗口+DTW+DBSCAN聚类 (725行)
- M967 MatchOutcomePredictor: ELO变种+贝叶斯多因素预测 (533行)
- M968 DraftSimulationEngine: MCTS蒙特卡洛BP模拟 (622行)
- M969 LaneMatchupAnalyzer: 对线CS/击杀/回城统计 (686行)
- M970 ItemBuildPathOptimizer: 出装效率+反制推荐 (701行)
- M971 RuneStrategyEngine: 对位符文优化+版本适配 (624行)
- M972 ObjectivePriorityForecaster: 龙/先锋/男爵争夺预测 (631行)
- M973 TeamfightSimulator: 团战胜率+阵容克制模拟 (628行)
- M974 WardingPatternAnalyzer: 视野热力图+盲区识别 (625行)
- M975 SummonerSpellTracker: 闪现/传送CD预测+倾向分类 (627行)

高级分析层 (M976-M979):
- M976 MomentumShiftDetector: 翻盘/滚雪球转折点 (627行)
- M977 RoamingPredictionEngine: 游走路径+时机预测 (625行)
- M978 FiddlerRealTimeAnalytics: Fiddler MCP实时流量分析 (704行)
- M979 CrossMatchPatternMiner: 跨对局行为指纹 (620行)

智能生成层 (M980-M983):
- M980 MetaAdaptationPredictor: 版本适应预测 (622行)
- M981 HistoryReplayIndexer: 回放关键时刻索引 (624行)
- M982 VoiceNarrationPipeline: 赛前/赛中语音播报TTS (696行)
- M983 TrainingDataExporter: RL三元组导出+AgentLightning对接 (666行)

编排层 (M984-M985):
- M984 IntelligenceReportGenerator: 多格式情报报告 (663行)
- M985 PredictiveIntelligenceOrchestrator: 统一编排+监控 (744行)

Seraphine API: connector.py retry/PastRequest模式适配
Fiddler MCP: localhost:8868实时流量分析
